@devp opened a pull request.

After a WebSocket reconnect the line-status chart briefly renders the last cached frame before the fresh snapshot arrives, so the status pill flips green -> grey -> green for about 400 ms. This holds the cached frame until the first message after reconnect lands.

Lena's repro from the sprint notes is added as an e2e spec.

